<!-- KLIC native HTML example. Styles/interactions: component bundle. KLIC example; preserve bundled per-file license notices. -->
<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="color-picker" data-kv-variant="text-background" data-klic-component="color-picker" class="kn-color-picker"><div data-kv-color-preview data-part="color-text-preview"><header data-part="heading"><strong>읽기 편한 문서</strong></header><p data-part="muted">텍스트와 배경의 조합을 확인하세요.</p></div><div class="ku-grid-2" data-part="grid-2"><label data-part="field"><span>본문 색상</span><input type="color" value="#172b49" data-kv-color-target="text" data-part="input"></label><label data-part="field"><span>배경 색상</span><input type="color" value="#edf2fc" data-kv-color-target="background" data-part="input"></label></div><output data-kv-color-output aria-live="polite" data-part="output"></output></div>
